Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:32:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: explain unavailable peers and correlate live delivery
 outcomes

Reject unavailable members before admission, retain safe failure diagnostics, and read exact native turn state even without reply text. Preserve uncertain receipts and never replay messages. Verified 11733 frontend tests, typecheck, session/storage/HTTP suites and legacy checks.
